      "text": "802.11n / WiFi 4: MIMO\n  Multiple spatial streams: 2×2, 3×3, 4×4 MIMO\n  Uses multipath reflections as independent channels (just like LTE MIMO)\n  40 MHz bonding: combines two 20 MHz channels → 2× throughput"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
