        "section": "telecommunications",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wireless Standards - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "802.11ac / WiFi 5:\n  160 MHz channel (4× wider than 802.11n in 5 GHz)\n  MU-MIMO downlink: AP serves 4 clients simultaneously (different beams)\n  802.11ac Wave 2: 8 spatial streams for AP, up to 8 clients simultaneously"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
