      "text": "802.11be / WiFi 7:\n  Multi-Link Operation (MLO): use multiple bands simultaneously per connection\n  320 MHz channels: double WiFi 6 channel width\n  4096-QAM: 12 bits/symbol (vs 10 in WiFi 6)\n```"
