      "text": "**WiFi channels**:\n```\n2.4 GHz CHANNELS (North America, 20 MHz wide):\n  Channels 1-13, spacing 5 MHz\n  Only 3 non-overlapping: 1, 6, 11 (each 22 MHz wide with rolloff)"
