        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CLASSIC BLUETOOTH (BR/EDR):\n  Frequency: 2.4 GHz ISM band\n  Frequency hopping: 1600 hops/sec over 79 channels (spread spectrum anti-interference)\n  Basic Rate (BR): 1 Mbps (GFSK)\n  Enhanced Data Rate (EDR): 2 Mbps (π/4-DQPSK) or 3 Mbps (8DPSK)\n  Range: ~10 m (Class 2, 2.5 mW) to ~100 m (Class 1, 100 mW)\n  Use: audio (headphones, speakers), data transfer, serial port profile"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#021",
      "path": [
        "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
