        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BLUETOOTH VERSIONS:\n  5.0 (2016): LE 2M, LE Coded, advertising extensions\n  5.1 (2019): Direction finding (AoA/AoD) → cm-level indoor positioning\n  5.2 (2020): LE Audio (LC3 codec), isochronous channels\n  5.3 (2021): Power improvements, connection subrating\n  5.4 (2023): Periodic Advertising with Responses (PAwR) for large-scale IoT"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#023",
      "path": [
