        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wireless Standards - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LE AUDIO (Bluetooth 5.2+):\n  New codec: LC3 (Low Complexity Communication Codec) → better quality at lower bitrate than SBC\n  Auracast broadcast audio: one source → unlimited BLE receivers (like FM radio but digital)\n  Multi-stream: separate streams to each ear → better stereo sync, hearing aids\n```"
    },
