        "title": "Wireless Standards - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ZIGBEE (IEEE 802.15.4):\n  Frequency: 2.4 GHz (16 ch) or 868/915 MHz\n  Data rate: 250 kbps (2.4 GHz)\n  Range: 10-100 m (mesh extends further)\n  Mesh networking: each node acts as router → self-healing network\n  Power: sleep current ~µA → years on batteries\n  Stack: Zigbee PRO, Zigbee 3.0 (unified profile)\n  Use: smart home (lighting, sensors), industrial automation, medical monitors"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#028",
      "path": [
        "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:telecommunications:08-wireless-standards, git-history:telecommunications:08-wireless-standards]",
        "canonical_path": "telecommunications/08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md",
        "concepts": "[wireless, standards]",
        "current_path": "telecommunications/08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:telecommunications:wireless-standards",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "telecommunications",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[wireless, standards]",
        "section": "telecommunications",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wireless Standards - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Z-WAVE:\n  Frequency: 900 MHz (US: 908.42 MHz, EU: 868.42 MHz)\n  Rate: 9.6 / 40 / 100 kbps\n  Range: 30 m indoor, 100 m outdoor\n  Always uses mesh\n  Max network: 232 devices per controller\n  Advantage: operates at 900 MHz → less congested than 2.4 GHz (no WiFi/BT interference)\n  Certification: stricter interoperability than Zigbee\n  Use: smart home security, thermostats, door locks"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#029",
      "path": [
        "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:telecommunications:08-wireless-standards, git-history:telecommunications:08-wireless-standards]",
