      },
      "text": "LORA (Long Range):\n  Physical layer: Chirp Spread Spectrum (CSS) modulation\n  Frequency: 433/868/915 MHz (regional specific)\n  Data rate: 0.3–50 kbps (depends on spreading factor)\n  Range: 5–15 km urban, 15–45 km rural, 100+ km LoS\n  Sensitivity: -137 dBm → enables very long range"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-WIRELESS-STANDARDS.md#034",
