        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Wireless Standards - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SPREADING FACTOR (SF):\n  SF7-SF12: trade-off between range and data rate\n  SF7: 5 kbps, shorter range\n  SF12: 0.3 kbps, maximum range, >1000x SF7 signal capture\n  Different SFs are orthogonal (can coexist in same channel)"
    }
